      "content": "okay i get that but i just really want to feel better. if i cant take the amoxicillin, what should i do? is there like a high dose of something i can take at home to knock this out? like maybe a bunch of ibuprofen or something to kill the infection instead? i just need something that works fast so i can get through work tomorrow.",
